{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/yournewhome.png?t=1741587873\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/elevator.gif?t=1741587873\" /><strong>Wrong Elevator</strong> is a horror game where you explore abandoned facilities and scavenging resources to maintain and upgrade your elevator.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/exploredepths.png?t=1741587873\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/shop.gif?t=1741587873\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to the darkest depths and explore eerie facilities. Traps and anomalies fill the corridors. Any stop you make could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/collect_items_new.png?t=1741587873\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/items.gif?t=1741587873\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect as many useful items and resources as possible before you run out of fuel or a light source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/maintain_elevator_new.png?t=1741587873\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/maintenance.gif?t=1741587873\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive in the depths, you will use collected resources to refuel, fix, and upgrade crucial parts of your <strong>Elevator</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/youarenotalone.png?t=1741587873\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/jumpscare.gif?t=1741587873\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your descent, you will face many unique and scary entities. You will need to find a way around every one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/endless_replayability_new.png?t=1741587873\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/nofuel.gif?t=1741587873\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wrong Floor is designed to be extremely replayable. Every run is unique. Every encounter is unpredictable. There are no checkpoints. Every death is a lesson.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875530?t=1741587873","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741587873","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/2ca994d4ef62dea82762c7070c36925d33afa2e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741587873","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/2ca994d4ef62dea82762c7070c36925d33afa2e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741587873","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor